+# T3 — proof reminders
+
+reuse: searched lib/ for a date or age helper; none exists, so remind.sh converts the time
+itself. It reads the newest floor proof through proof_last.
+
+Evidence: `bash tests/remind.test.sh` → rc=0
+```
+ok - no floor proof is said
+ok - a fresh floor proof says nothing
+ok - an old floor proof is said
+```
diff --git a/tests/remind.test.sh b/tests/remind.test.sh
new file mode 100644
